  "_about": [
    "Curated list of Sofia neighbourhoods used to normalize whatever Mapbox / Nominatim / a user typed into a single canonical Bulgarian name (no ж.к./кв./в.з. prefixes, no Latin transliteration).",
    "Why curated: OSM returns 'ж.к. Иван Вазов' for half of Lozenets, 'кв. Кръстова вада' for the other half, 'Centre' or 'Център' depending on accept-language, 'Mladost 1' or 'Младост 1' for the same place. The leaderboard splits these into separate buckets. This list collapses every alias to one canonical Cyrillic label.",
    "Lookup algorithm (see _normalize_sofia_neighbourhood in routes/waitlist.py):",
    "  1. Strip the line-1 prefix: ж.к., ж.к, ж.р., кв., в.з., с., м., с., село, кв (case- and dot-insensitive).",
    "  2. Trim, collapse internal whitespace, casefold.",
    "  3. Look up in the alias map (keys list below). First hit wins.",
    "  4. Return the entry's `bg` field (single canonical Cyrillic name, no prefix).",
    "  5. Miss → return the string with prefix stripped, capitalized (best-effort).",
    "Numbers are part of the name (Младост 1 ≠ Младост 4 — different blocks for delivery logistics, different leaderboard buckets by intent)."
  ],
